-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material: AMD FidelityFX SDK (FSR4)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following parts of this repository are derived from AMD's FidelityFX SDK
FSR4 source and remain under AMD's MIT license (notice reproduced below):

  - shaders/overrides/post_common.hlsli
      Modified copy of AMD's include/gpu/fsr4/post_common.hlsli.
  - src/model/forward_nhwc.cu
      The fixed activation quantization scales (kConvNextScales,
      kFasterNet32Scales, kFasterNet64Scales) are taken from AMD's FSR4 INT8
      model HLSL. The rest of the file is original work.
  - include/fsr4/ffx_api_compat.h, src/dll/fsr2_compat.h
      Binary-compatible redeclarations of FidelityFX API types; names and
      values mirror AMD's SDK headers.
  - Generated locally from your own copy of the FSR4 source, never committed:
      shaders/compiled/*.cso, src/dll/fsr4_shader_blobs.h,
      src/dll/fsr4_initializer_blob.h, src/dll/fsr4_encoder1_weights.h,
      weights/ (output of scripts/extract_fsr4_weights.py).
    Builds of the D3D12 DLL embed this material; distributing such a build
    requires keeping the notice below with it.

